A zero-dependency HTML sanitizer that parses HTML the way the browser does. Deny-by-default, ~3KB in the browser, ~2.3x faster than [sanitize-html](https://github.com/apostrophecms/sanitize-html), and it ships a byte-identical drop-in for it too.
